From: Brice Dutheil <brice.dutheil@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Jan 2015 12:32:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Move PowerMock onto repackaged Mockito 1.10.19 internals

This evidence patch keeps the call-chain and version-bearing subset of
upstream commit d9615ecf221413b1661a891d02de43175f460b6b. The full commit
adds 924 lines of vendored Mockito implementation. In that omitted vendored
body, AcrossJVMSerializationFeature directly imports and throws
org.mockito.exceptions.base.MockitoSerializationIssue. This is source
evidence, not an independently applicable client repair.

